Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 03:18:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/15] chore(14-04): add Poppins/SpaceMono fonts (gate paths)
 and PNG+SVG brand marks; write prometheus_fonts.css (DESIGN-03, DESIGN-05,
 D-10, D-11)

- Poppins ttf (4 weights) at third_party/poppins/Poppins-{Thin,Light,ExtraBold,Black}.ttf (gate Assertion 1 lines 41-44)
- Poppins woff2 (4 weights) at third_party/poppins/*.woff2 (gate Assertion 1 lines 35-38); converted from TTF via fonttools
- SpaceMono-Regular.ttf + .woff2 at third_party/space_mono/ (gate Assertion 1 lines 47-48); woff2 converted from TTF
- All 5 woff2 + 5 ttf also copied to chrome/browser/resources/prometheus/fonts/ for GRD packaging (14-06)
- pm_mark_dark.png + pm_mark_light.png: PM monogram rasterized at 512px from SVG sources (gate lines 55-56)
- pm_wordmark_dark.png + pm_wordmark_light.png: Prometheus wordmark rasterized at 512px (gate lines 57-58)
- fsb_logo_dark.png + fsb_logo_light.png + fsb_icon.png: copied from project assets/ (gate lines 61-62)
- pm_mark_light.svg: REAL light variant (dark ink #1f1a17 on transparent/light surface), NOT a copy of dark (DESIGN-05)
- pm_mark_dark.svg + pm_wordmark_{dark,light}.svg: SVG sources alongside PNGs for crisp WebUI rendering
- prometheus_fonts.css: 5 @font-face rules with //resources/prometheus/fonts/ URL scheme; NO local() fallback (D-11 offline guarantee)
